::MODULE{DAILY_TASK|title:每日单页发文任务}
  # 严格按美区真实月搜从大到小发文，一天一页，一个牌子一页，不开无词页，不许造词，不许估量
  # 批次池（8个品牌开页，1个太小不开）：
  1 | 2026-09-21 | hellofresh gift card (3600) | HelloFresh | /guides/hellofresh-gift-card/ | status: published
  2 | 2026-09-22 | home chef gift card (1000) | Home Chef | /guides/home-chef-gift-card/ | status: published
  3 | 2026-09-23 | factor gift card (880) | Factor | /guides/factor-gift-card/ | status: published
  4 | 2026-09-24 | blue apron gift card (720) | Blue Apron | /guides/blue-apron-gift-card/ | status: published
  5 | 2026-09-25 | cookunity gift card (390) | CookUnity | /guides/cookunity-gift-card/ | status: published
  6 | 2026-09-26 | hungryroot gift card (320) | Hungryroot | /guides/hungryroot-gift-card/ | status: published
  7 | 2026-09-27 | everyplate gift card (110) | EveryPlate | /guides/everyplate-gift-card/ | status: queued
  8 | 2026-09-28 | marley spoon gift card (50) | Marley Spoon | /guides/marley-spoon-gift-card/ | status: queued
  # 排除规则：dinnerly gift card (20) 流量太小，不开页
  cadence: 1_page_per_day
  batch_size: 8
  current_task_index: 1
  runner: python tools/daily_publish_gift_cards.py
  rule: 官方源地址加复核日期 核不到的字段留空写 Unconfirmed 官方页当下是空的就照实写空 第一屏就是答案

